### Layer 3 — Surface
- [ ] No changes

### Layer 4 — Interaction
- [ ] No changes

**Verification:**
- [ ] Unit test: visibleCount returns 1 for xsPortrait, 2 for xsLandscape (when configured)
- [ ] Regression: Verify existing breakpoint behavior unchanged

