## Scope Contract 8: ProductSpotlight Layout Refactor

**Objective:** Remove min-height constraint and add md breakpoint for smoother transitions

**Affected Files:**
- `ProductSpotlight1.tsx`
- `ProductSpotlight2.tsx`
- `ProductSpotlight3.tsx`

**DoD Sequence:**

### Layer 1 — Structure
- [ ] Modify all 3 ProductSpotlight components
- [ ] Identify grid container and content areas

### Layer 2 — Layout
- [ ] Remove min-height constraints: delete `min-h-[500px] lg:min-h-[600px]`
- [ ] Add md breakpoint to grid: change `grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2` to `grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2`
- [ ] Verify padding progression: `p-8 lg:p-12` (may need `md:p-10`)

### Layer 3 — Surface
- [ ] No color changes
- [ ] No typography changes

### Layer 4 — Interaction
- [ ] No changes

**Verification:**
- [ ] Visual test: 768px-1023px portrait - two-column layout displays
- [ ] Visual test: 768px-1023px landscape - no overflow issues
- [ ] Visual test: Section height adapts to content without min-height
- [ ] Regression: Verify no layout breakage at 1024px+

