## Post-Sprint: Regression Verification

### Mandatory Verification Steps

**1. Visual Regression Testing**
- [ ] Screenshot comparison at all audit breakpoints:
  - 260px, 320px, 480px (portrait & landscape)
  - 640px, 768px (portrait & landscape)
  - 1024px, 1280px, 1440px (portrait & landscape)
- [ ] Verify all 11 critical issues resolved
- [ ] Verify no new layout issues introduced

**2. Functional Testing**
- [ ] All carousels scroll correctly at all breakpoints
- [ ] All buttons remain clickable
- [ ] All images load without layout shift

**3. Build Verification**
- [ ] `npm run build` completes without errors
- [ ] TypeScript compilation passes
- [ ] No console errors in production build

**4. Performance Verification**
- [ ] Lighthouse mobile score ≥ previous
- [ ] Lighthouse desktop score ≥ previous
- [ ] Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) ≤ 0.1

