## Sprint Execution Order

### Phase 1: Foundation (No visual changes)
1. Scope Contract 1: Design System Extension
2. Scope Contract 2: Grid Component Enhancement
3. Scope Contract 6: Carousel Breakpoint Map Expansion

### Phase 2: Component Fixes (Visual changes, low risk)
4. Scope Contract 4: IEMs Gallery Header Fix
5. Scope Contract 3: Hero Layout Fixes
6. Scope Contract 5: IEMs Card Sizing Optimization
7. Scope Contract 11: Accessories Card Height Fix

### Phase 3: Layout Refactors (Higher risk, test thoroughly)
8. Scope Contract 8: ProductSpotlight Layout Refactor (all 3)
9. Scope Contract 9: NewestRelease Consistency Fix

### Phase 4: Carousel Optimizations (Test all carousels)
10. Scope Contract 7: Featured Carousel Optimization
11. Scope Contract 10: DACs Carousel Optimization
12. Scope Contract 12: Accessories Carousel Optimization

### Phase 5: Verification
13. Post-Sprint Regression Verification (all items)

